            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> 1. There is no keymap for the comma: `repeat_jump_back = ','` (discussed in [PR#1077](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1077)).\n\nA more relevant discussion is #282.\n\n> 2\\. It doesn't support forced linewise mode: `dVf(`.\n\nThat was not on the radar when the module was created. Should be pretty straightforward to add, I think.\n\n---\n\nAlso, please, don't revive 4.5 year old issue for this. A more proper place would be a new discussion in 'Discussions'.",
